&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pronto AI is a global leader in commercializing autonomous vehicle (AV) technology, deploying Autonomous Haulage Systems (AHS) that automate operations in mines, quarries, and construction sites worldwide. While much of the industry remains in R&amp;amp;D, we deliver real, production-ready autonomy that is already operating in the field. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are on a mission to make mining operations safer, smarter, and more efficient through cutting-edge technology, and we are building toward becoming the world’s first profitable AV technology company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remotely support deployment of Pronto&#39;s autonomous haulage system (AHS) across multiple mine sites, tracking truck bring-up, rover installation, and system commissioning progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and document site-level issues (equipment faults, comms failures, installation delays) reported by on-site teams, and escalate blockers to the Field Operations Manager and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate logistics remotely with customer site teams, including permitting, work authorizations, and equipment/route readiness, via calls, Slack, and shared trackers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor production and administrative delays against project milestones, maintaining structured trackers for visibility across distributed stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer training sessions on Pronto technology remotely, and assist with handover documentation to the mine&#39;s operations team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a remote point of contact for routine operational questions, keeping Pronto HQ informed through regular status updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help monitor safety compliance and site-specific protocols by coordinating with on-site personnel, flagging gaps for follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel short-term to customer sites as needed when issues require hands-on troubleshooting or in-person coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–7 years of experience in a mining, heavy equipment, or industrial field operations environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating remotely on active mine site projects, understanding production and safety-critical environments without needing daily physical presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior exposure to technology rollouts (autonomy, remote operations, telematics, or machine control systems) is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills, with the ability to track multiple open issues across sites and time zones and communicate status clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working async and coordinating across time zones with international customer sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel short-term (days to a couple weeks) when a site requires in-person troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear verbal and written communication skills for coordinating across customer and internal teams without in-person contact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Mining Engineering, a related technical field, or equivalent hands-on industry experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on real, production-deployed autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build technology that directly improves safety, efficiency, and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackle complex challenges in demanding, real-world environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a fast-moving team with high ownership and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See your work deployed and making a difference in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with experienced engineers and industry operators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What else you need to know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a remote role. As a company driven by innovation and continuous change, close collaboration is essential. We’re constantly reimagining our industry, creating new products, and refining our processes, and we do our best work together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
