&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in restaurant, foodservice, QSR, fast-casual, commissary, or similar operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple restaurant or foodservice locations is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning or supporting labor, food cost, staffing, manager development, facilities, inventory, health and safety, and location KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of labor scheduling, productivity, and labor-cost management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of food cost, inventory, waste, purchasing, and basic restaurant/unit economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining food-safety, cleanliness, and operational standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people-management skills, including coaching, accountability, performance management, and leader development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using operational data and KPIs to identify problems and make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable learning scheduling, timekeeping, inventory, purchasing, POS/order-management, and SOP/task-management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New-store or kitchen-opening experience is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working onsite and being hands-on with frontline teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
