&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demand for online food delivery is growing really fast! In the last 5 years, just in the US, the overall market has expanded 10x from $10B to $100B, and could expand to $500B- $1T by 2030.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the restaurant industry: You’ll be part of a team that helps restaurants succeed in online food delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative environment: You will receive support and guidance from experienced colleagues and managers, helping you to learn, grow, and achieve your goals, and you’ll work closely with other teams to ensure our customers’ success.&lt;/li&gt;
