&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate pairs sharp creative judgment with commercial discipline. You think in systems - voice, identity, messaging architecture - but you&#39;re just as comfortable in the weeds of a campaign or a landing page. You know how to build a brand that means something to an enterprise decision-maker and at the same time a regular consumer choosing the right lunch option. You&#39;ve built the function, led the team, and raised the bar on the work and you&#39;re energized by doing it across growing businesses at once.&lt;/p&gt;
