&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Jakarta&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;office. Atoms is a company driven by invention and continuous change - we are constantly reimagining our industries, building new products, and refining how we operate. We do our best work together. That’s why all of our office-based teams work onsite, five days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to join us as we serve those who serve others?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay: Ranging from $40.00 - $50.00/hr + Full Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;CloudKitchens helps restaurateurs around the world succeed in online food delivery - our goal is to make food more affordable, higher quality, and convenient for everyone.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We take underutilized properties and transform them into smart kitchens so they can better serve restaurateurs, customers, and the neighborhoods they’re in. Every time we launch a new facility, we create jobs in that neighborhood, and we’re proud to provide a wide range of cuisines and options for healthy food at an affordable price.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re changing the game for restaurateurs, whether they’re entrepreneurs opening their first restaurant, all the way through to your favorite global quick-service restaurant chains.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facility Maintenance &amp;amp; Building Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute hands-on facility maintenance and minor construction work, including drywall repairs, closet frame-outs, patching, painting, and structural fit-outs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct planned preventative maintenance (PPM) on building infrastructure and facility equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform servicing, troubleshooting, and preventative maintenance on HVAC and refrigeration systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a clean, safe, and organized shop area, disposing of debris and ensuring tools and materials are properly handled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warehouse Operations &amp;amp; Material Flow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage material flow within the facility, assisting engineering and operations teams with moving larger units and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safely operate material handling equipment, including forklifts and pallet jacks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build custom wooden crates, pallets, and packaging to secure materials and equipment for shipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support site deliveries, intake, and logistics as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Quality Assurance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with facility leadership and engineering teams to flag issues early, log work completed, and resolve site challenges efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as a self-starter who takes initiative during downtime to maintain facility standards and prevent operational bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
