&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of hands-on experience in commercial/industrial facility maintenance, handyman work, construction, or building engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HVAC / Mechanical Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Working knowledge of HVAC system basics and building mechanical/electrical/plumbing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certifications:&lt;/strong&gt; EPA Universal certification; Forklift certification required (or ability to become certified upon hire).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trade Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient with common hand tools, power tools, shop equipment, drywalling, framing, and general building repairs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to safely lift, move, and carry equipment or materials weighing up to 50 lbs, and work at heights when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset &amp;amp; Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong communication skills, high reliability, attention to detail, and a proactive self-starter attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formal HVAC/R trade school training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in multi-site commercial facilities, warehouses, or technology/R&amp;amp;D operational spaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Single facility site in Pittsburgh, PA (On-site).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time regular schedule with potential for overtime as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Dynamic, fast-paced warehouse and tech facility environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To:&lt;/strong&gt; Alexander Wyatt (Training &amp;amp; Development)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demand for online food delivery is growing really fast! In the last 5 years, just in the US, the overall market has expanded 10X from $10B to $100B, and could expand to $500B- $1T by 2030.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the restaurant industry: You’ll be part of a team that helps restaurants succeed in online food delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative environment: You will receive support and guidance from experienced colleagues and managers, helping you to learn, grow and achieve your goals, and you’ll work closely with other teams to ensure our customer’s success.&lt;/li&gt;
