&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain standardized data models and reporting templates for consistent measurement across the MENA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, automate, and maintain dashboards, reports, and analytical models using Google Sheets, Excel, and other BI tools to support decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
