&lt;li&gt;Collect, clean, and analyze operational and system usage data to identify trends, adoption challenges, and opportunities for process improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze operational and system usage data to identify areas for efficiency gains and improved adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train users on dashboards, trackers, and systems, ensuring teams understand how and why to input data correctly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and track key performance indicators (KPIs) for real estate development, including cost, schedule, risk, and platform adoption metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating complex data into clear, actionable recommendations (slides, dashboards, and written summaries).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connecting and integrating multiple data sources, such as Excel, JSON, CSV, SQL databases, SharePoint, and APIs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
