&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Engineering, Data Science, Business Analytics, Information Systems, or another analytical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5+ years of experience as a Data Analyst, Business Analyst, or in a similar data-driven role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional skills in Google Sheets and Excel (dashboards, pivot tables, automation, reporting).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of forecasting concepts, including trends and projection techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL and BI tools (Tableau, Power BI, Looker, or similar) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
