&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to grow into &lt;strong&gt;Facilities or Regional leadership roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a rapidly growing operation in a &lt;strong&gt;$100B+ industry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent problem-solving&lt;/strong&gt; with access to a &lt;strong&gt;collaborative support network&lt;/strong&gt; (engineering, senior techs) for complex escalations&lt;/li&gt;
