&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;20%&lt;/strong&gt; troubleshooting &amp;amp; diagnostics (onsite + remote)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10%&lt;/strong&gt; inspections, reporting, and system verification&lt;/li&gt;
