&lt;li&gt;Develop, review, and update employment policies, employee handbooks, and compliance documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with strategic workforce integrations from an employment law and HR compliance perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet regularly with HR leadership to address emerging employment issues and provide legal guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with federal, state (particularly California), and local employment law requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
