&lt;p&gt;This role is for someone who thrives in ambiguity, solves complex problems, and delivers high-quality legal work quickly. You&#39;ll handle a varied docket and also help shape how Atoms anticipates, manages, and resolves disputes as the company grows.&lt;/p&gt;
