&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and resolve litigated disputes.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead litigation and arbitration matters hands-on. That means selecting and proactively managing outside counsel, while handling matters in-house when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run internal discovery and e-discovery.&lt;/strong&gt; Manage legal holds, document collection, preservation, and production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Train and educate.&lt;/strong&gt; Design and deliver practical legal training for business partners on topics such as dispute avoidance, professional communication, and escalation protocols. This means developing familiarity with company operations and stakeholders to identify needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
