&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Los Angeles&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;office. As a company driven by invention and continuous change - we are constantly reimagining our industries, building new products, and refining how we operate. We do our best work together. That’s why all of our office-based teams work onsite, five days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
