&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quem Somos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Pronto AI é líder global na comercialização de tecnologia para veículos autônomos (AV), implementando Sistemas Autônomos de Transporte (Autonomous Haulage Systems - AHS) que automatizam operações em minas, pedreiras e canteiros de obras ao redor do mundo. Enquanto grande parte da indústria ainda está focada em pesquisa e desenvolvimento, nós entregamos soluções de autonomia reais, prontas para produção e já em operação em campo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nossa missão é tornar as operações de mineração mais seguras, inteligentes e eficientes por meio de tecnologia de ponta. Estamos construindo o caminho para nos tornarmos a primeira empresa de tecnologia para veículos autônomos lucrativa do mundo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sobre a oportunidade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A posição tem base no escritório da Pronto em Vila da Serra (Nova Lima/Belo Horizonte), com presença frequente em minas no Brasil e em outros países (até 50% do tempo em viagem). A jornada de trabalho exige flexibilidade para acompanhar a dinâmica de operações industriais.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;O que você fará (Responsabilidades)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liderar e expandir as iniciativas de desenvolvimento de negócios e vendas da Pronto na América Latina, focando na expansão comercial em minas e operações industriais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gerenciar o ciclo completo de desenvolvimento de negócios, desde a prospecção de novos clientes, qualificação de leads e negociação de contratos até o fechamento de grandes parcerias comerciais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mapear e construir relacionamentos de longo prazo com executivos de alto nível (C-level), diretores de operações e tomadores de decisão em grandes mineradoras e grupos industriais na região LATAM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Definir e executar a estratégia regional de entrada no mercado (Go-To-Market), colaborando ativamente com as equipes globais de engenharia, produto e liderança nos EUA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identificar novas oportunidades de mercado, acompanhar concorrência e tendências do setor de automação e robótica industrial para adaptar as propostas de valor locais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Realizar visitas de campo e reuniões presenciais frequentes em sites operacionais para entender as necessidades específicas dos clientes e apoiar a elaboração de propostas técnicas e comerciais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trabalhar em estreita colaboração com as equipes de projetos, operações e engenharia para assegurar a transição fluida do processo de vendas para a execução e entrega do produto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;O que buscamos &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requisitos obrigatórios&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inglês fluente ou avançado (imprescindível para comunicação diária com a liderança e equipes dos EUA) - Parte do processo seletivo será conduzido em Inglês.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Espanhol intermediário ou avançado.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formação superior completa em Engenharia, Administração, Economia ou áreas correlatas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sólida experiência comprovada em desenvolvimento de negócios, vendas complexas de B2B, gestão de contas globais/regionais ou desenvolvimento de parcerias estratégicas no setor de mineração ou indústria pesada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Histórico demonstrado de atingimento e superação de metas comerciais complexas e fechamento de contratos de alto valor econômico.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forte capacidade de negociação, comunicação interpessoal, articulação técnica e negociação de contratos complexos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disponibilidade para viagens frequentes (até 50% do tempo) no Brasil e em outros países da América Latina.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carteira nacional de habilitação (CNH categoria B) válida.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diferenciais (Desejável)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiência prévia com venda de tecnologia industrial, sistemas de automação de mina, frotas ou robótica.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amplos contatos e rede estabelecida de relacionamentos na indústria mineradora na LATAM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Por que se juntar a Pronto?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trabalhe com tecnologia de autonomia já implantada e operando em ambientes reais de produção;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desenvolva soluções que impactam diretamente a segurança, eficiência e produtividade das operações;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enfrente desafios complexos em ambientes exigentes e do mundo real;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faça parte de uma equipe ágil, com alto nível de autonomia, responsabilidade e impacto;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Veja seu trabalho sendo implementado e gerando resultados concretos em campo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Colabore de perto com engenheiros experientes e especialistas da indústria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to join us as we serve those who serve others?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atoms is building the machines that power the next era of progress.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the last decade, software has transformed the digital world. But the physical world, where food is made, minerals are mined, goods are moved, and industries are run, remains far less intelligent, far less efficient, and far more constrained. We’re changing that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atoms builds Physical AI— real-world robots for the industries that move civilization forward, starting with food, mining, and transport. Our systems are designed to understand, predict, and control the real world with precision, turning complex physical operations into something more reliable, more scalable, and more productive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This work requires more than robotics. It requires deep integration across hardware, software, AI, operations, manufacturing, and real estate. We don’t just build machines in a lab. We deploy them into real environments, operate them, learn from them, and improve them until they work at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are roboticists, engineers, operators, and builders. We believe the next great technology companies will not only transform information, but the physical systems that shape everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to work on hard problems with real-world impact, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a senior content and communications leader to own the portfolio-wide content and comms layer across Atoms&#39; Food, Mining, and Transport businesses, and to build the calendar and relationships that bring a coherent public narrative to a company operating in four very different industries at once (food, mining, transport, robotics).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The mandate is broad: set the strategy for how Atoms shows up across traditional and new media. You will build and run all the external media– podcast &amp;amp; interview opportunities, content creator partnerships, content that will drive business and the talent brand forward. You will build a network of vertical-embedded agencies and operators that make that coverage happen; and make the calls on sequencing and tier as the company moves out of a long stretch of near-total media stealth. You will operate as a direct advisor to Atoms leadership on when and how each vertical&#39;s moments become public.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The right person has built a media and comms function from zero at a high-growth, product-and-regulator-adjacent company, reported directly to leadership, and turned a multi-faceted business into one coherent public narrative.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the company-wide moment calendar&lt;/strong&gt;, sequencing partnership announcements, fundraises, key hires, and first-site or product launches so they compound into a coherent story rather than compete with each other for attention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and run the vertical media network&lt;/strong&gt;, recruiting and managing boutique agencies and individual operators embedded in each industry&#39;s press ecosystem, in place of a single centralized firm covering all four.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead new-media strategy for Atoms leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, identifying and securing placements with the top-tier and niche podcasts/shows/events most relevant to each vertical&#39;s audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run a top tier content creation&lt;/strong&gt; team that will be responsible for producing high quality media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set channel and tier strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, operating the existing architecture — newsroom as system of record, blog/Perspectives for thesis-level narrative, company LinkedIn for amplification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive customer-forward storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;, shifting the default from Atoms talking about its customers to structuring press moments where customers speak directly about their own growth — surfacing CloudKitchens, Picnic, or other Atoms companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advise leadership directly&lt;/strong&gt; on the timing, framing, and risk of every major public moment across a business where the wrong call carries real regulatory and partnership consequences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in media and communications, including direct experience building a content &amp;amp; media function from zero at a high-growth company in a regulated or partnership-dependent industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of reporting directly into leadership as a strategic advisor, not just an executor of a plan set by someone else.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Range across the full spectrum of comms work — product launches, funding announcements, executive comms, crisis response, internal comms — rather than depth in a single lane.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a portfolio of boutique agency relationships in parallel, in place of one centralized firm of record.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The judgment to hold several distinct narratives at once — food delivery, mining, robotics — without collapsing them into one generic voice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high creative bar for producing video and written content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound instincts for substance-forward, low-combativeness media strategy, with an understanding of the asymmetric downside of an adversarial press strategy for a business built on partnerships and regulatory relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships in one or more of: restaurant tech, industrial/mining press, robotics and deep tech, or business/finance trade media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building new-media placement strategy for founders or executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
