&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PCB &amp;amp; Carrier Board Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the design and revision of custom circuit boards and carrier boards for vehicle compute, sensors (camera, radar, lidar), GPS, and actuation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vehicle &amp;amp; Protocol Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist with analyzing and debugging automotive communication protocols (CAN, CAN FD, Ethernet) on real vehicle test platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware Validation &amp;amp; Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Help design, assemble, and execute test procedures and hardware test fixtures to validate board designs and troubleshoot edge cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fleet Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with hardware and software engineers on vehicle bring-up, fleet installations, and physical hardware troubleshooting on-site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
