&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associate’s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience working with core CRM systems such as Zendesk, HubSpot, or UJET.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience supporting internal employees or drivers on operational, scheduling, or timekeeping topics.&lt;/li&gt;
