&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quem Somos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Pronto AI é líder global na comercialização de tecnologia para veículos autônomos (AV), implementando Sistemas Autônomos de Transporte (Autonomous Haulage Systems - AHS) que automatizam operações em minas, pedreiras e canteiros de obras ao redor do mundo. Enquanto grande parte da indústria ainda está focada em pesquisa e desenvolvimento, nós entregamos soluções de autonomia reais, prontas para produção e já em operação em campo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nossa missão é tornar as operações de mineração mais seguras, inteligentes e eficientes por meio de tecnologia de ponta. Estamos construindo o caminho para nos tornarmos a primeira empresa de tecnologia para veículos autônomos lucrativa do mundo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sobre a oportunidade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Buscamos engenheiros(as) de robótica entusiasmados por causar impacto real no mundo. Se você tem sede por desafios técnicos, gosta de colocar a mão na massa e quer trabalhar com tecnologia de ponta, colaborando com nossas equipes internacionais, esta é a sua oportunidade de participar ativamente da criação de soluções inovadoras que estão redefinindo a indústria de caminhões autônomos.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A posição tem base no escritório da Pronto em Vila da Serra (Nova Lima/Belo Horizonte), com visitas ocasionais a minas no Brasil e em outros países. A jornada de trabalho pode variar conforme as necessidades operacionais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Durante o processo seletivo, é essencial responder ao questionário de experiências que acompanha a candidatura. Candidaturas sem respostas não serão consideradas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;O que buscamos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilidades&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garantir sustentação da operação de caminhões autônomos em produção, garantindo a operação contínua e eficiente em todas as operações globais da Pronto;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executar diagnósticos e debugging em sistemas Linux, identificando e solucionando problemas em firmware, software e sistemas embarcados;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manter comunicação direta com clientes e equipes locais, atendendo às demandas operacionais e garantindo alinhamento técnico;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apoiar a instalação e integração de dispositivos em novas operações, contribuindo para a implantação e expansão das frotas;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desenvolver ferramentas de debugging e monitoramento para otimizar o suporte técnico e a análise de falhas;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desenvolver software para sistemas autônomos, colaborando com equipes internacionais em projetos de robótica avançada;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Atuar em tópicos diversos da robótica, como localização, controles, planejamento de trajeto, sistemas de segurança, fusão de sensores, integração com hardware personalizado ou de terceiros, pipelines de câmeras e/ou aprendizado de máquina.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requisitos (obrigatórios)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mínimo de 2 anos de experiência profissional em desenvolvimento de software, hardware e/ou robótica;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conhecimento avançado em sistemas Linux;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiência prática com debugging de sistemas embarcados;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiência em conexões remotas (SSH) e ferramentas de linha de comando;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programação em Python ou C/C++ para análise e correção de códigos;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inglês avançado ou fluente, para comunicação constante com equipes globais e leitura e escrita de documentação em inglês;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diferenciais (desejáveis)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiência com gerenciamento de processos (supervisor ou similares);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conhecimento de protocolos de comunicação e diagnóstico de conectividade;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domínio de ferramentas de rede em Linux (tcpdump, candump, Wireshark, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiaridade com controle de versão (Git);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projetos pessoais de automação, robótica ou eletrônica;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiência com prototipagem rápida e solução de problemas em hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carteira de motorista categoria B válida.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Por que se juntar à Pronto?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trabalhe com tecnologia de autonomia já implantada e operando em ambientes reais de produção;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desenvolva soluções que impactam diretamente a segurança, eficiência e produtividade das operações;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enfrente desafios complexos em ambientes exigentes e do mundo real;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faça parte de uma equipe ágil, com alto nível de autonomia, responsabilidade e impacto;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Veja seu trabalho sendo implementado e gerando resultados concretos em campo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Colabore de perto com engenheiros experientes e especialistas da indústria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;O que mais você precisa saber&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;A posição terá base na região de &lt;strong&gt;Vila da Serra (Nova Lima/Belo Horizonte)&lt;/strong&gt;, para atuar diretamente em mina de grande porte. Por ser um perfil de alta versatilidade, o profissional navegará por todos os ambientes do projeto: escritórios, oficinas de manutenção, salas de controle e as operações em campo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to join us as we serve those who serve others?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the past, to be a successful restaurateur, you simply had to have a passion for food and a passion for people - but to succeed as a digital restaurateur you also need to have a passion for technology. We believe in the joy of serving others, and that&#39;s why we created Otter – to help restaurateurs succeed in online food delivery. Restaurants around the world, both large and small, including Chick-fil-A, Ben &amp;amp; Jerry’s, KFC, and Eataly trust our software to power their delivery business. We increase sales, reduce order issues, and decrease delivery headaches.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Engineering Manager to spearhead our evolution from traditional analytics to a next-generation intelligence platform. This is a great opportunity to lead a team managing the data behind roughly 80% of all online food orders in the US, and modernize our ecosystem by building an impeccable data foundation that moves beyond static charts into live, conversational insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Empower merchants with fast, trustworthy, and actionable metrics that change how they run their businesses every single day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Otter Insights End-to-End:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the strategy for everything inside Business Manager (pipelines and datasets to the semantic modeling layer and customer-facing embedded analytics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Ingestion to Serving:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive both real-time and batch pipelines, ensuring canonical datasets and robust APIs are built to empower other internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale the Semantic Layer:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee frameworks (like Cube/SQLMesh) to ensure metrics and dimensions remain consistent across batch and real-time processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Data Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish analytics engineering standards and ensure adoption across broader product teams to maintain high data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship High-Performance Products:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver data-intensive, customer-facing applications including the Analytics App, Analytics Studio, automated reports, and data-sharing APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deploy Safe AI Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Build automated AI insights on top of governed metrics, implementing strict guardrails, observability, and customer-impact triage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Coach the Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Hire, mentor, and retain a cross-functional team of analytics engineers and full-stack/frontend engineers while setting technical direction across the stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Blended Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; 4+ years of experience leading engineering teams across both data/platform and product domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Team Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record building and scaling diverse teams (backend, analytics engineering, and full-stack/frontend)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Data Modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong background in data modeling and semantic layers, alongside a history of delivering B2B or customer-facing analytics products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic Data Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience implementing data lineage, catalogs, compliance, and quality frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Executive Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to collaborate closely with PMs, designers, and executive stakeholders w&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Stack Accountability:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfort owning end-to-end operational health, monitoring incidents, and managing on-call rotations from the data pipeline down to the user interface.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forward-Looking Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine interest in establishing AI-ready data foundations and building AI-enabled insights on top of certified metrics and metadata.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Platform &amp;amp; Analytics Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with SQLMesh, dbt, and Cube.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline CI/CD, data observability, and orchestration (Flink / or similar batch tools)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClickHouse, Pinot, or Trino&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data access controls, platform hardening, and permissioned sharing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applications &amp;amp; Insights (Full-Stack)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering experience across React, TypeScript, and Java (or Kotlin/Scala)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building dashboards, custom charts, automated report scheduling, and data exports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and implementing secure, permissioned data-sharing APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Domain Experience (A Plus, Not Required)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restaurant, marketplace, or delivery analytics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Otter Business Manager is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demand for online food delivery is growing really fast! In the last 5 years, just in the US, the overall market has expanded 10X from $10B to $100B, and could expand to $500bn- $1T by 2030.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the restaurant industry: You’ll be part of a team that helps restaurants succeed in online food delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative environment: You will receive support and guidance from experienced colleagues and managers, helping you to learn, grow and achieve your goals, and you’ll work closely with other teams to ensure our customer’s success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What else you need to know &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Seattle office location. As a company driven by innovation and continuous change, close collaboration is essential. We’re constantly reimagining our industry, creating new products, and refining our processes, and we do our best work together. That’s why all of our office-based teams work onsite, five days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
