&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;We&#39;re changing the game for restaurateurs whether they’re entrepreneurs opening their first restaurant all the way through to your favorite global quick-service restaurant chains.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage maintenance and repairs within budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English B2+/C1&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and facilitate building and systems maintenance, equipment repair and replacement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide advanced maintenance troubleshooting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage contractors to ensure maintenance, custodial, TI, etc. work is completed to a high standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with kitchen onboarding team to oversee equipment move-in, TIs, routine inspections &amp;amp; go-live for new licensees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide engineering support for retrofit plans within area of expertise for onboarding, enterprise, and development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand building and health codes, build relationships with local officials to keep the facility 100% operational&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand local preventative maintenance requirements (e.g. FD hood cleaning); create, schedule, supervise and track all facility PM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and own call-list of local vendors to perform necessary facility maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate small projects requiring single or multiple trades/contractors and manage vendor relationships, SOPs, quality of work &amp;amp; pricing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages facility technicians I &amp;amp; II in their respective regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing market: you’ll be focused on an $80 billion market projected to reach at least $500 billion by 2030 in the US alone.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the restaurant industry: you’ll be part of a team that helps restaurants succeed in online food delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative environment: you will receive support and guidance from experienced colleagues and managers, helping you to learn, grow, and achieve your goals, and you’ll work closely with other teams to ensure our customer’s success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bits and atoms: our products live at the intersection of the physical and digital worlds. You’ll get first-hand, on-the-field feedback of how our experiences are used by our customers in kitchens!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What else you need to know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our&lt;strong&gt; Bogotá&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;office location. We believe that people do their best work when they are together. As a company, we’re in the marketplace of ideas and innovation. When you’re constantly innovating, changing how an industry works, inventing new products and processes - and we are doing all these things - we believe we’re better as a team in person. That’s why all of our teams (except for our field-based roles) are now working from one of our office locations 5 days a week. Looking forward to sharing more about a Career of Substance at CloudKitchens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to join us as we serve those who serve others?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pronto AI is a global leader in commercializing autonomous vehicle (AV) technology, deploying Autonomous Haulage Systems (AHS) that automate operations in mines, quarries, and construction sites worldwide. While much of the industry remains in R&amp;amp;D, we deliver real, production-ready autonomy that is already operating in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are on a mission to make mining operations safer, smarter, and more efficient through cutting-edge technology, and we are building toward becoming the world’s first profitable AV technology company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pronto is seeking a seasoned mining professional to lead our on-site deployments. As the Mining Engineer, you will be the bridge between Pronto’s cutting-edge technology and the customer’s day-to-day mining operations. You will be responsible for managing a high-performing technical team, ensuring the customer meets their infrastructure commitments, and delivering the project according to strict performance and safety criteria.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Delivery &amp;amp; Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success Criteria: Deliver projects to the agreed-upon performance metrics and success criteria, ensuring the autonomous system is integrated seamlessly into the mine’s production cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership: Manage the local field team, overseeing permitting, scheduling, safety compliance, and overall work performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Management: Hold the customer accountable for their deliverables, including resource commitments, machine availability, and site/route/equipment readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Liaison&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primary Point of Contact: Act as the central communication hub between the customer site and Pronto HQ, providing regular progress reports and escalating technical or operational blockers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process Integration: Work with customers to set up or modify existing operational processes to accommodate autonomous haulage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handover &amp;amp; Training: Lead the customer training programs on Pronto technology and manage the formal handover of the system to the mine’s operations team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mining Expertise: 15+ years of direct mining experience. You must be extremely comfortable and knowledgeable in a mine site environment, understanding the nuances of production and safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership Tenure: 5–10 years in a leadership role (e.g., Site Superintendent, Maintenance Manager, or Fleet Manager).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech Rollout Experience: Proven track record of actively participating in technology rollouts, such as autonomy, remote operations, telematics, or machine control systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: A University Degree in Mining Engineering is required to establish immediate credibility with customer stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Authority: The ability to command respect on-site and influence customer decision-making to ensure site readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability: Deep understanding of how to transition a mine from manual to technology-assisted or autonomous operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: Exceptional verbal and written communication skills for reporting to executive-level stakeholders at both the customer and Pronto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions &amp;amp; Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-Site Deployment: This is an on-site role. During deployments, you will stay regional to the customer in local accommodations or in customer-provided quarters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mining Schedule: Working schedules are based on mining rotations (e.g., x weeks on, y weeks off) rather than a standard office week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current Project Commitment: To complete the existing demo at Ma’aden, the successful candidate should expect to spend approximately 2 months remaining on-site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to traverse rugged mine sites and work in extreme environmental conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance with all site-specific health and safety requirements, including medical clearances.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on real, production-deployed autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build technology that directly improves safety, efficiency, and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackle complex challenges in demanding, real-world environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a fast-moving team with high ownership and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See your work deployed and making a difference in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with experienced engineers and industry operators.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What else you need to know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a field-based role supporting operations across the Middle East. Atoms is a company driven by invention and continuous change—we are constantly reimagining our industries, building new products, and refining how we operate. This position requires travel across the Middle East. up to 75% of the time. Candidates should be comfortable with frequent travel and a highly mobile work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to join us as we serve those who serve others?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pronto AI is a global leader in commercializing autonomous vehicle (AV) technology, deploying Autonomous Haulage Systems (AHS) that automate operations in mines, quarries, and construction sites worldwide. While much of the industry remains in R&amp;amp;D, we deliver real, production-ready autonomy that is already operating in the field. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are on a mission to make mining operations safer, smarter, and more efficient through cutting-edge technology, and we are building toward becoming the world’s first profitable AV technology company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Field Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;is a hands-on role, responsible for the installation, preventive maintenance, and repair of Pronto&#39;s advanced technology solutions across a range of customer locations. This position plays a critical role in ensuring successful deployment and optimal performance of Pronto equipment in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Installation &amp;amp; Deployment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electrical and mechanical Scoping of Construction and Mining equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform on-site installation of Pronto hardware and software solutions, including sensor systems, DBW kits, power integration, and vehicle interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On site installation of peripheral hardware such as network stations, gate systems and office infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct system calibrations and validation tests to ensure installations meet operational standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Engineering and Customer teams to ensure field deployments align with specifications and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering on R&amp;amp;D projects&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with customer teams on training and technical maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preventive Maintenance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out scheduled maintenance tasks to ensure system health, reliability, and long-term performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and log equipment conditions, identifying signs of wear, degradation, or environmental impacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Troubleshooting &amp;amp; Repair&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and repair hardware, software, and connectivity issues in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize diagnostic tools and logs to identify root causes and implement fixes with minimal downtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate findings clearly to engineering teams for deeper analysis and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the face of Pronto during on-site visits, maintaining professional and responsive communication with customer personnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide basic training to customer staff when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document all service activities, updates, and issues using internal ticketing and CRM tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree in Mechanical, Electrical, Systems Engineering or other relevant discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in field service, automotive electronics, mechatronics, or a similar technical support role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with hand tools, diagnostic equipment, and electrical testing tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of vehicle systems (power, CAN bus, sensors, ECUs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read wiring diagrams, schematics, and follow technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working independently in field environments and with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 75% to customer sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Arizona, Florida, Texas or Wyoming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with autonomous vehicle systems, heavy equipment, machine control, robotics, or complex sensor integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Linux-based systems and remote diagnostics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OSHA 10 or equivalent safety certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift up to 50 pounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of standing, bending, and working in and around vehicles for extended periods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working outdoors in varying weather conditions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on real, production-deployed autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build technology that directly improves safety, efficiency, and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackle complex challenges in demanding, real-world environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a fast-moving team with high ownership and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See your work deployed and making a difference in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with experienced engineers and industry operators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What else you need to know&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a company driven by innovation and continuous change, close collaboration is essential. We’re constantly reimagining our industry, creating new products, and refining our processes, and we do our best work together. While this role is remote, travel to our various field sites across the US is a critical part of this operation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is &lt;strong&gt;$110,000-$165,000&lt;/strong&gt; per year and will vary based on location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actual compensation will be determined on an individual basis and may vary depending on experience, skills, and qualifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary is just one part of your total rewards package. You may also be eligible for equity awards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits Summary (USA Full-Time Exempt Employees):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, Vision, Disability, and Life Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Account / Health Savings Account Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sick Time, Unlimited Flexible Time Off, and Paid Holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Parental Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-Tax Commuter Benefit Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits are subject to change at the company&#39;s discretion.&lt;br&gt;Pronto accepts applications on an ongoing basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to join us as we serve those who serve others?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
