&lt;p&gt;This is a&lt;strong&gt; field-based role&lt;/strong&gt; supporting operations across the United States. Atoms is a company driven by invention and continuous change—we are constantly reimagining our industries, building new products, and refining how we operate. This position requires travel across the U.S. up to 75% of the time. Candidates should be comfortable with frequent travel and a highly mobile work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base starting rate for this role is&lt;strong&gt; $27.88 - $35.10 per hour.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actual compensation will be determined on an individual basis and may vary depending on experience, skills, and qualifications.&lt;/p&gt;
