&lt;li&gt;Design and build high-performance React applications powered by WebSockets, SSE, and GraphQL subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to and shape our courier mobile apps built in React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical design for complex features and systems, from initial architecture through production rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own projects end-to-end, driving execution, technical decisions, and cross-functional alignment&lt;/li&gt;
