&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across frontend, backend, cloud infrastructure, integrations, and robot-adjacent interfaces. You will partner closely with product, culinary, operations, robotics, firmware and mechanical teams to turn ambiguous operational problems into reliable software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we scale up, this team will work closely with our product and robotics software teams to solve exciting problems around release and deployment, configuration, learning management, and refining the robot interface.&lt;/p&gt;
