&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker, Protobuf, Python, Terraform, and Git.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with remove simulation environments, along with standing up simulated backend services or making use of such services in unit/integration tests (potentially remove)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL, Superset, Jupyter notebooks, and other tools used for analyzing data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
