&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and strategic Global Supply Chain Manager (GSM) to lead supplier development and sourcing efforts for our next-generation robotic systems. This role is critical to the success of our engineering and product development teams, and we’re looking for someone who can identify and develop relationships with world-class suppliers, build long-term relationships, and negotiate complex contracts. The ideal candidate will bring a combination of technical understanding, supply chain savvy, and polished relationship-building skills to help bring our innovative hardware products to market&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineering teams to understand product roadmaps and identify supply chain needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, evaluate, and onboard strategic suppliers and manufacturing partners across a global landscape.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong, collaborative relationships with key suppliers—generating excitement around our product vision and aligning roadmaps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate complex contracts and supply agreements that balance cost, quality, schedule, and long-term strategic goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive sourcing decisions using detailed cost analysis, manufacturing feasibility, supplier capability assessments, and risk mitigation planning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor supplier performance and coordinate with engineering, quality, and manufacturing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with finance, legal, and operations to ensure sourcing strategies align with broader company objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized, data-driven decision making—leveraging sheets, dashboards, and analysis to support forecasting, supplier scorecards, and cost tracking.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of supply chain, sourcing, or supplier management experience in a high-growth hardware or technology company (e.g., robotics, consumer electronics, medical devices).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in strategic sourcing, supplier negotiations, and contract development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and maintain strong supplier relationships that go beyond transactions and into co-development partnerships.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and organizational skills; able to juggle multiple vendors, categories, and timelines simultaneously.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, and interpersonal skills—confident interacting with executives, engineers, and global suppliers alike.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
