&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atoms is seeking a Director of Brand to lead the teams and strategies responsible for managing the Atoms brand and leading communications strategies. This is a high-impact leadership role that reports to the Chief Experience Officer and sits at the intersection of marketing, creative production, operations, and strategy. This role owns lifecycle and communication strategies across the business and oversees the brand team managing partnerships, events, social media, and design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is a strong strategist and natural collaborator with a strong track record of building brand campaigns internally and externally. This person brings sharp analytical instincts and a bias for action: someone who can design systems at scale, own a budget, test and iterate quickly, and still roll up their sleeves when progress is on the line. We&#39;re looking for someone who thinks end-to-end about the Atoms journey and is obsessed with making every experience exceptional—from our drivers to our customers. If you&#39;ve led a communications strategy, managed brand campaigns, and love solving complex problems, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
