&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience, including 3+ years in a leadership role, preferably in marketing or brand management. Startup experience is a plus!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing 360 campaigns&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning and managing a CRM platform—bonus points if you have experience with Braze&lt;/li&gt;
