&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Lifecycle Marketing Manager to own the strategy and execution of lifecycle communications across Atom&#39;s&#39;s core audiences: riders and drivers. This is a hands-on, high-impact role that sits at the intersection of marketing, operations, recruiting, and data. This role builds and optimizes the engagement programs that turn first-time riders into loyal customers, move driver candidates from application to first shift, and keep our employee drivers informed, engaged, and recognized throughout their time at Atom&#39;s.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is a strong strategist and hands-on builder with a track record of driving measurable results through lifecycle marketing. This person brings sharp analytical instincts and a bias for action: someone who can design journeys at scale, segment audiences thoughtfully, test and iterate quickly, and write compelling, on-brand messaging. We&#39;re looking for someone who thinks end-to-end about the rider and driver journey and is obsessed with making every touchpoint feel like Atom&#39;s. If you&#39;ve built lifecycle programs in Braze, love turning data into better experiences, and are excited about loyalty and rewards, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own lifecycle marketing strategy across riders and drivers from first touch through long-term retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, launch, and manage automated email, SMS, in-app, and push journeys in Braze, including onboarding, activation, engagement, win-back, and retention programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Recruiting to build candidate journeys that move driver applicants from application to first shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the driver communications that keep our drivers informed, engaged, and recognized&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally throughout the organization, including with Operations and Training to ensure our communications meet the needs of the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop rider lifecycle programs that encourage first rides, repeat usage, and membership engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape and execute Atom&#39;s loyalty and rewards programming, including the Driver Milestone Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build segmentation and personalization strategies using behavioral, operational, and market data, partnering with Engineering to advance our data strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run A/B tests on messaging, timing, channels, and offers, and turn results into clear recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on lifecycle performance, including engagement, conversion, and retention metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Braze best practices, including data quality, deliverability, and message frequency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–7 years of experience in lifecycle, CRM, or retention marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building and optimizing automated email, push, SMS, and in-app programs at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with a CRM or marketing automation platform—Braze strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with segmentation, personalization, and A/B testing, using data to drive decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong writing skills with an eye for clear, concise, on-brand messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of testing, iterating, and improving processes quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills and bias for action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills, with the ability to manage competing priorities across multiple markets and audiences&lt;/li&gt;
