&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pronto AI is a global leader in commercializing autonomous vehicle (AV) technology, deploying Autonomous Haulage Systems (AHS) that automate operations in mines, quarries, and construction sites worldwide. While much of the industry remains in R&amp;amp;D, we deliver real, production-ready autonomy that is already operating in the field. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are on a mission to make mining operations safer, smarter, and more efficient through cutting-edge technology, and we are building toward becoming the world’s first profitable AV technology company.&lt;/p&gt;
