&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with robotic systems is strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience/ expertise with 3D CAD tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience building mechanical and/or electrical systems; machine shop and/or fabrication experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for CNC machine, sheet metal fab, and 3D print&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hydraulic systems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
