&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Namaa, we build and operate tech-enabled urban infrastructure that gives consumers fast, reliable access to meals, groceries, and everyday essentials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Traditional retail models, built around brick-and-mortar locations, often struggle to compete in today’s digital-first landscape. Challenges such as cost efficiency per square foot, logistics-optimized locations, and seamless technology integration have made it clear that a new approach is needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of foodservice and commerce lies in purpose-built infrastructure designed for speed, accuracy, and scalability. That’s why Namaa was established—to power the next generation of digital food and quick commerce ecosystems across the Middle East.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ecosystem is driven by a portfolio of specialized business units, including &lt;strong&gt;KitchenPark&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;CloudRetail&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Profood Properties&lt;/strong&gt;, each playing a key role in enabling brands to grow and thrive in an increasingly on-demand world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are seeking an experienced MEP Draftsman with strong expertise in developing and updating MEP drawings across Mechanical, Electrical, Plumbing, Fire Fighting, and ELV systems. This role supports all MEP projects by preparing shop drawings, layouts, details, and technical documentation in coordination with construction teams and project stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare, revise, and finalize complete sets of MEP shop drawings for all mechanical, electrical, plumbing, and fire protection systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop detailed layouts including: HVAC systems, plumbing networks, fire alarm/firefighting, ELV systems, electrical layouts, and single-line diagrams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and update Reflected Ceiling Plans (RCPs) in coordination with construction managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure drawings comply with project specifications, standards, and consultant comments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce schedules, legends, sections, and typical details as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized archives of all drawings, ensuring updated logs and revision control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate closely with the project, engineering, and site teams to gather technical information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage drawing submissions, tracking, and document control for all MEP design packages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the preparation of as-built drawings upon project completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with different engineering disciplines to ensure design accuracy and alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel within the Middle East when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10 years of experience as an MEP Draftsman.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mechanical Technical Diploma or a related MEP field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency in AutoCAD; and good command of Revit is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in medium-scale building projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English (reading, writing, speaking).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, coordination, and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and manage multiple submission timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience Preparing BOQs - preferrable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience calculating quantities of all MEP items - preferrable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demand for online food delivery is growing really fast! In the last 5 years, just in the US, the overall market has expanded 10X from $10B to $100B, and could expand to $500bn- $1T by 2030.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the restaurant industry: You’ll be part of a team that helps restaurants succeed in online food delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative environment: You will receive support and guidance from experienced colleagues and managers, helping you to learn, grow and achieve your goals, and you’ll work closely with other teams to ensure our customer’s success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What else you need to know&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Jordan office location. As a company driven by innovation and continuous change, close collaboration is essential. We’re constantly reimagining our industry, creating new products, and refining our processes, and we do our best work together. That’s why all of our office-based teams work onsite, five days a week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
