&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Namaa, we build and operate tech-enabled urban infrastructure that gives consumers fast, reliable access to meals, groceries, and everyday essentials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Traditional retail models, built around brick-and-mortar locations, often struggle to compete in today’s digital-first landscape. Challenges such as cost efficiency per square foot, logistics-optimized locations, and seamless technology integration have made it clear that a new approach is needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of foodservice and commerce lies in purpose-built infrastructure designed for speed, accuracy, and scalability. That’s why Namaa was established—to power the next generation of digital food and quick commerce ecosystems across the Middle East.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ecosystem is driven by a portfolio of specialized business units, including &lt;strong&gt;KitchenPark&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;CloudRetail&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Profood Properties&lt;/strong&gt;, each playing a key role in enabling brands to grow and thrive in an increasingly on-demand world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Operations Manager ensures smooth and efficient daily operations across one or more processing centers in Saudi Arabia. This role oversees facility operations, inventory, and process optimization while supporting cross-functional teams to meet performance goals. The Operations Manager leads training, resolves operational issues, and ensures readiness for high-volume periods, maintaining seamless execution and strong customer satisfaction across all sites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the smooth operation of the processing center across all shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads training and meeting sessions for the processing staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General handy-person duties around the hub, a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with Property Manager to ensure work around the facility is completed on an appropriate timeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address facility, tech, and space issues with licensees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with Customer Success team members to ensure licensees are ready for big orders/ launches/ spikes in business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoots processing center, kitchen, and facility hardware issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inventory &amp;amp; Ordering; Audits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review daily inventories and make orders to replenish inventories when needed&lt;/li&gt;
