&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage corporate secretarial and entity maintenance matters across our Middle East entities, including registrations, renewals, annual filings, KYC/UBO requirements and other corporate compliance obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and coordinate corporate documentation, including board and shareholder resolutions, powers of attorney, authority documents, and documents relating to entity formations, amendments and other corporate changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain corporate governance records, including signing authority matrices, POA trackers, corporate databases, entity management systems and organisational charts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate entity changes, including changes to directors/managers, authorised signatories, registered addresses, share capital and ownership information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the execution, notarisation, apostille/legalisation and certification of corporate and legal documents across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with PROs/GROs and local teams on licensing, registrations and other government-facing requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with external counsel and corporate service providers across different jurisdictions, ensuring filings, renewals and deliverables are followed through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Legal Team with legal operations, including document routing, execution and storage, filing deadlines, trackers and improvements to internal legal processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with internal stakeholders across Finance, Tax, People, Real Estate and other business teams on corporate and governance matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide broader paralegal and legal support to the Middle East Legal Team as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
