&lt;li&gt;Own the full risk operations portfolio, including transaction fraud, account takeovers, chargebacks, refunds and appeasements, promotional abuse, KYC/KYB, sanctions related operations, and emerging risk vectors. Continuously evaluate where our controls need to evolve as the business and threat landscape change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the central point of contact for major fraud events and high severity payment or risk escalations, including executive escalations. Take ownership of the response, bring together the right stakeholders, and drive issues through resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently and navigate ambiguity with minimal guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
