&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the organization:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead org design, workforce planning, and headcount strategy as teams scale and priorities shift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the talent cycle:&lt;/strong&gt; Run performance reviews, calibrations, leveling, and promotions for engineering and product, and partner closely with compensation on pay decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build leaders:&lt;/strong&gt; Run talent reviews, strengthen the bench of engineering managers and directors, and coach technical leaders at every level.&lt;/li&gt;
