&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring 7 to 10 years of HR experience, including a senior HR or people business partner role supporting a product and engineering organization of several hundred or more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have done this work at a company known for the strength of its engineering, and you understand how technical teams are built, leveled, and managed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have partnered directly with a CTO, VP of Engineering, or Chief Product Officer and are credible with technical leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have owned engineering performance and calibration cycles, career ladders, and promotion processes at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
