&lt;li&gt;Lead procurement and sourcing strategies for construction projects, materials, equipment, and services from planning through project completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Construction, Operations, Finance, Legal, and other teams to understand project needs, identify suppliers, and develop sourcing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source, evaluate, and manage general contractors, subcontractors, consultants, vendors, and suppliers across multiple projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead RFx/RFP processes, analyze bids and proposals, negotiate pricing and commercial terms, and execute supplier agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify cost-saving opportunities while balancing project quality, timelines, and operational requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage key vendor relationships, including performance, pricing, contracts, payment terms, risk, and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with construction teams to ensure materials and services are sourced and delivered according to project schedules and key milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor market trends, material costs, vendor capacity, and supply risks that could impact construction timelines or budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and improve procurement processes, tools, reporting, and vendor management practices as the company scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple sourcing initiatives independently and provide recommendations and results to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter with an ownership mindset, driven to learn fast, go deep, and become a true expert in procurement, construction, and supplier strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder who can own cost from concept to completion, coordinating estimates across design phases, procuring GCs, architects, and engineers, and managing contracts while maintaining tight control over project cash flow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong negotiator who leads sourcing efforts end-to-end, confidently navigating complex, high-stakes vendor, supplier, and contractor negotiations to consistently secure best-in-class terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An operator who can orchestrate pricing, logistics, and sequencing of specialized kitchen construction materials across a national footprint with precision and speed.&lt;/li&gt;
