&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the past, to be a successful restaurateur, you simply had to have a passion for food and a passion for people - but to succeed as a digital restaurateur you also need to have a passion for technology. We believe in the joy of serving others, and that&#39;s why we created Otter – to help restaurateurs succeed in online food delivery. Restaurants around the world, both large and small, including Chick-fil-A, Ben &amp;amp; Jerry’s, KFC, and Eataly trust our software to power their delivery business. We increase sales, reduce order issues, and decrease delivery headaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Product Manager for Product-Led Growth (PLG), you’ll own the roadmap for how Otter grows through the product itself. This role is focused on building a self-serve growth engine that improves acquisition, activation, monetization, and retention. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run experiments to improve funnel efficiency, reduce CAC, and increase conversion from lead → customer → expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build features and flows that generate organic growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive monetization through pricing experiments, upsell opportunities, and CRM-driven campaigns that expand LTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing, Sales, and Data Science to enrich leads, improve attribution, and optimize channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track success metrics – CAC, LTV, conversion rates, activation velocity, and self-serve revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with engineering, design, and GTM to ship fast, learn quickly, and scale what works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of product management or relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building and scaling growth-focused product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative skills: comfortable with SQL, experimentation, and growth modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative problem solver with a bias toward fast learning and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator who can align GTM, data, and product teams around a shared growth roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: experience in SaaS, marketplaces, or restaurant/commerce technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing market: You’ll be focused on an $80 billion market that’s projected to reach at least $500 billion by 2030 in the US alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry transformation: You’ll be part of a team redefining how restaurants run both online and offline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact at scale: What you build will directly power thousands of restaurants and millions of diners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative environment: You’ll work closely with talented colleagues across teams, with the support and guidance to grow your career.&lt;/li&gt;
