&lt;li&gt;Experience in California or other high-friction permitting environments, including building support among the stakeholders who control approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating complex environmental approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing outside consultants and expediters.&lt;/li&gt;
