&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Namaa, we build and operate tech-enabled urban infrastructure that gives consumers fast, reliable access to meals, groceries, and everyday essentials.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Traditional retail models, built around brick-and-mortar locations, often struggle to compete in today’s digital-first landscape. Challenges such as cost efficiency per square foot, logistics-optimized locations, and seamless technology integration have made it clear that a new approach is needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of foodservice and commerce lies in purpose-built infrastructure designed for speed, accuracy, and scalability. That’s why Namaa was established—to power the next generation of digital food and quick commerce ecosystems across the Middle East.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ecosystem is driven by a portfolio of specialized business units, including &lt;strong&gt;KitchenPark&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;CloudRetail&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Profood Properties&lt;/strong&gt;, each playing a key role in enabling brands to grow and thive in an increasingly on-demand world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Recruiter to join our Dubai team. You’ll own end-to-end, high-volume recruitment across a diverse range of corporate and commercial roles, partnering closely with hiring managers to deliver strong candidates efficiently.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage end-to-end recruitment across junior to mid-level positions, from sourcing and screening through to offer negotiation and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a high volume of vacancies simultaneously, with the ability to prioritise and maintain momentum across multiple hiring processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong candidate pipelines through direct sourcing, networking, referrals, and other recruitment channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with hiring managers to understand role requirements, calibrate profiles, and provide market insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screen and assess candidates against role requirements, ensuring strong technical and cultural alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage candidates throughout the interview process and ensure a strong candidate experience from initial contact through offer stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead offer discussions, manage expectations, negotiate within approved compensation frameworks, and successfully close candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit across a variety of corporate and commercial functions, including sales and construction roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate recruitment data, reporting, and pipeline updates to ensure clear visibility on hiring progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all required documentation is completed accurately before transitioning successful candidates to the onboarding process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the wider recruitment team with sourcing and hiring projects as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of proven end-to-end recruitment experience, covering sourcing, screening, interviewing, offer management, negotiation, and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing a high volume of vacancies simultaneously, ideally 15+ active roles at one time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting across corporate functions and sales/commercial positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong direct sourcing and candidate pipeline-building experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple stakeholders and hiring processes in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both Arabic and English is needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, organisation, prioritisation, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting within the construction industry is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demand for online food delivery is growing really fast! In the last 5 years, just in the US, the overall market has expanded 10X from $10B to $100B, and could expand to $500bn- $1T by 2030.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the restaurant industry: You’ll be part of a team that helps restaurants succeed in online food delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative environment: You will receive support and guidance from experienced colleagues and managers, helping you to learn, grow and achieve your goals, and you’ll work closely with other teams to ensure our customer’s success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What else you need to know&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Dubai office location. As a company driven by innovation and continuous change, close collaboration is essential. We’re constantly reimagining our industry, creating new products, and refining our processes, and we do our best work together. That’s why all of our office-based teams work onsite, five days a week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to join us as we serve those who serve others?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atoms is building the machines that power the next era of progress.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the last decade, software has transformed the digital world. But the physical world, where food is made, minerals are mined, goods are moved, and industries are run, remains far less intelligent, far less efficient, and far more constrained. We’re changing that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atoms builds Physical AI— real-world robots for the industries that move civilization forward, starting with food, mining, and transport. Our systems are designed to understand, predict, and control the real world with precision, turning complex physical operations into something more reliable, more scalable, and more productive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This work requires more than robotics. It requires deep integration across hardware, software, AI, operations, manufacturing, and real estate. We don’t just build machines in a lab. We deploy them into real environments, operate them, learn from them, and improve them until they work at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are roboticists, engineers, operators, and builders. We believe the next great technology companies will not only transform information, but the physical systems that shape everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to work on hard problems with real-world impact, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Recruiter, you will play a critical role in scaling the teams in Atoms across the Middle East and beyond.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the full recruitment lifecycle for Field Engineering and Field Operations roles supporting autonomous haulage deployments, including on-site rotational positions at mining operations in Saudi Arabia and the Middle East&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner directly with leadership and site managers to define hiring needs, calibrate on technical talent, and align recruiting strategy to deployment timelines and customer commitments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build deep pipelines across three distinct talent pools: mining operations leaders (Site Superintendents, Fleet Managers, Maintenance Managers with autonomy or technology rollout experience); field service and mechatronics technicians (vehicle electrics, CAN bus, sensors, ECUs, heavy equipment); and robotics/software engineers (Linux, embedded systems, Python/C++, localisation, controls, sensor fusion).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Market-map the mining, heavy equipment OEM, automotive electronics and autonomous vehicle sectors to find talent that rarely applies through job boards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sell a demanding proposition well: FIFO rotations, rugged site environments, five-day onsite work, and the chance to put autonomy into production rather than a slide deck.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive strategic hiring initiatives that improve time-to-fill, increase hiring quality, and support aggressive deployment plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use funnel data and insights to identify bottlenecks, streamline workflows, and maintain a consistently high bar for talent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4–6 years of full-cycle recruiting experience, ideally hiring technical, field or operations talent for mining, heavy industry, construction equipment, automotive, robotics or autonomous vehicle companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working understanding of the roles you&#39;ll hire for: you can hold a credible conversation about mine production cycles, DBW kits and CAN diagnostics, or embedded Linux debugging, and know what a strong profile looks like in each.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience recruiting for remote, rotational or site-based roles, and familiarity with GCC labour markets and mobilisation (Saudi Arabia and the wider Middle East) is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven success managing high-impact, fast-moving searches across multiple geographies and time zones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strategic partner who can influence engineering and operations leaders, advise on talent markets, and drive clarity in role definition and levelling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional communicator able to build trust with senior stakeholders, site leadership and hands-on technical candidates alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Highly organised, detail-oriented and data-driven, with the ability to thrive in a fast-paced, execution-heavy environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mission-first mindset: comfortable operating with urgency and extreme ownership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Atoms, you’ll work on one of the defining challenges of our time—bringing automation into the physical world to drive real, lasting impact. We exist to uncover valuable unknown truths and turn them into progress, which means constantly pushing beyond what’s known and building what doesn’t yet exist. The work is ambitious and often challenging, but it’s grounded in a shared sense of purpose and a team committed to seeing it through together. Our work only matters if it serves others, and we know that meaningful progress depends on the trust of the people we serve and the strength of our team—so we invest in both, creating an environment where you can do your best work and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What else you need to know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Dubai&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;office. Atoms is a company driven by invention and continuous change - we are constantly reimagining our industries, building new products, and refining how we operate. We do our best work together. That’s why all of our office-based teams work onsite, five days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to join us as we serve those who serve others?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we’re reinventing the way employees experience lunch at work. By partnering with top local restaurants and batching hundreds of orders, we make it easy for companies to offer high-quality, individually packed meals, without fees or tips. Our mission is to create a seamless, affordable, and joyful lunch experience that benefits both employees and employers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Restaurant Operations Manager, you’ll own restaurant supply for Los Angeles: find the right restaurants, sign the partner, and make sure they deliver: enough capacity, prepped on time, packaged properly, with menus and photos worth ordering from. That means real ownership and real accountability from day one. You’ll spend time in facilities and restaurants, tasting food and talking to operators&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Selection.&lt;/strong&gt; Selection depth and cuisine coverage are a key KPI. You decide where it comes from: brick-and-mortar partners, standalone restaurants, and CK facility operators (with CK sales). You make sure every hub has real options at the different price tiers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Restaurant performance.&lt;/strong&gt; Signing, onboarding, launch, and ongoing health. You own the capacity model, drive on-time prep, and make the pause and unpause calls. If a partner’s prep-by times slip in month three, that’s yours to diagnose and fix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Menu quality.&lt;/strong&gt; Menus, hero shots, item photos, tags, descriptions, and ratings are your product surface. You curate items that travel well and make sense as a single packed lunch, and eliminate recurring defects: missing photos, broken modifiers, misleading prices, items the kitchen doesn’t make.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team.&lt;/strong&gt; You work with a Bogotá-based team across restaurant sales and onboarding, menu operations, and frontline support (POS, printers, tablets). You set the standards, SLAs, and routing, and improve the systems behind the work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food-Obsessed Market Expert:&lt;/strong&gt; Knows the region’s food scene: neighborhood staples, the brands eaters keep asking for, the spot that opened last month that nobody’s covering yet. Can name the five brands we should be chasing off the top of your head.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Somehow-some-way mentality: &lt;/strong&gt;Find a path to the signing even when the operator says no, the owner is unreachable, or the kitchen isn’t set up for batch orders. When a brand is a priority, you figure out how to get it on Picnic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Literate Operator: &lt;/strong&gt;Read a lateness report or a cuisine gap analysis and know exactly which restaurant to call. Convert supply and performance data into a clear, actionable plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder and Team Leader:&lt;/strong&gt; Close a partner in the morning and debug a menu modifier in the afternoon. Lead through others across time zones, and treat the same broken menu twice as a process failure, not bad luck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assertive Negotiator:&lt;/strong&gt; Understand Picnic’s commission structure and restaurant economics. Hold the commission line and still leave the operator feeling like a partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant experience, including at least 2 managing a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in restaurants, food delivery, marketplaces, hospitality, or supply-side operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning a supply base or partner portfolio, spanning both acquisition and ongoing performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of restaurant operations: kitchen workflow, POS systems (Toast, Square, Clover), menu management, ticket flow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with data: lateness reports, dashboards, and Google Sheets should not slow you down&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spanish is a plus given the team is based in Bogotá&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You genuinely love food, and you know your region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who does not wait for a lead list&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity: the playbook is half-written and you’ll write the rest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High standards and low tolerance for recurring defects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’d rather be in a kitchen than on a call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to be in the field: facility visits, restaurant walk-ins, tastings&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive real impact: Be part of building the operational engine behind a fast-growing startup that’s redefining how work gets done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your city: Take full ownership of your city’s performance and see the direct results of your ideas and execution every single day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with purpose: Join a mission-driven team focused on making the workplace experience better for thousands of people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow with us&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; At Picnic, there’s room to grow—personally and professionally—as we scale and take on new challenges together.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What else you need to know&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Los Angeles office location. As a company driven by innovation and continuous change, close collaboration is essential. We’re constantly reimagining our industry, creating new products, and refining our processes, and we do our best work together. That’s why all of our office-based teams work onsite, five days a week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is&lt;strong&gt; $&amp;nbsp;$93,000 to $109,000 per year.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actual compensation will be determined on an individual basis and may vary depending on experience, skills, and qualifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary is just one part of your total rewards package. You may also be eligible for equity awards and an annual performance-based bonus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits Summary (USA Full-Time Exempt Employees):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance (multiple plans, incl. HSA options).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid life and disability insurance (short- and long-term).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voluntary insurance: accident, critical illness, hospital indemnity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optional supplemental life insurance for self, spouse, and children.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet insurance discount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Savings Account (HSA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Accounts (Healthcare, Dependent Care, Commuter)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Off policies:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary vacation days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 paid holidays per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Bereavement leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits are subject to change at the company&#39;s discretion.&lt;br&gt;Atoms accepts applications on an ongoing basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to join us as we serve those who serve others?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
