&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Madrid office. As a company driven by innovation and continuous change, close collaboration is essential. We&#39;re constantly reimagining our industry, creating new products, and refining our processes, and we do our best work together. That&#39;s why all of our office-based teams work onsite, five days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
