&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with simulation environments, along with standing up simulated backend services or making use of such services in unit/integration tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL, Superset, Jupyter notebooks, and other tools used for analyzing data.&lt;/li&gt;
