&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Sales Engineer to be the technical partner to our enterprise go to market&amp;nbsp; team. You&#39;ll work alongside Account Executives on deals with national brands, multi-unit franchisees, and franchise groups, translating what our platform does into outcomes an operator, a CFO, or a CTO cares about.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The products you&#39;ll support go well beyond ordering. One of them is a machine learning system that decides, store by store and week by week, where a brand&#39;s delivery marketing dollars should go and how hard they should work. Others take on the manual, error-prone work enterprise teams do today across dozens of platforms and systems, including making sure every dollar owed is actually collected. Part of your job is being able to explain how these work, prove that they work, and be honest about where they don&#39;t fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
