&lt;li&gt;Partner with Account Executives through the full enterprise sales cycle, from discovery through technical validation, pilot, and close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead tailored product demos for audiences ranging from franchise owners to brand marketing leads, finance teams, and IT/engineering stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run technical discovery: understand a prospect&#39;s POS environment, marketplace footprint, data flows, and current marketing and reconciliation processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, scope, and support pilots, including defining success metrics, test and control structures, and readouts that hold up to scrutiny from a data-literate buyer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build pre-sale analyses using a prospect&#39;s own performance data and public marketplace signals to size the opportunity before a contract is signed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical sections of RFPs and security questionnaires, working with Product and Engineering to make sure every claim we make is one we can back up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring field feedback back to Product: what enterprise buyers are asking for, where deals stall, and which integrations are unlocking revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain reusable demo environments, technical collateral, and ROI frameworks the broader sales team can use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
