&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the building design process with internal and external project stakeholders, from concept through delivery of a successful, buildable design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Architect/Engineer of Record (AEOR) relationships, scope, and performance across multiple concurrent projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead test-fitting and schematic modeling and drawing for new sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate advanced building systems across design disciplines to keep projects technically aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate architectural/engineering due diligence work during site acquisition and feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
