&lt;li&gt;Triage and resolve frontline engineering issues, identifying root causes for intermittent electrical or firmware faults.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write work instructions and checklists for junior technicians Coordinate scheduled service and vehicle preparation for test Train junior technicians and review their work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with cross-functional engineering teams to drive design-for-serviceability improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain our shop space, where assembly of production parts happens, keeping the space clean and organized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
