&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience configuring and administering Linear, including its API and automation rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in autonomous vehicles, automotive, EV, robotics, aerospace, heavy equipment, or industrial machinery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work as an engineer, technician, or operator.&lt;/li&gt;
