&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of a technical program or internal system end to end, from requirements through delivery and sustained adoption by users who were not required to use it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in environments where physical asset state and software state must be kept reconciled, in autonomous vehicles, automotive, EV, robotics, or aerospace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of engineering change and configuration management, including BOM structure and revision control, ECR and ECO workflow, effectivity, serialization and genealogy, and as-designed to as-built reconciliation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of software configuration and release management, including version and build identity, update and flashing paths, parameter and calibration management, and fleet-wide version reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience designing an operational process and measuring adherence to it, with the ability to describe what was measured and what the results showed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication across requirements, decision records, and status reporting, for technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
