&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Quality Engineer to build quality for our compute box build, from incoming material through the unit that ships. In this role, you will set the inspection standards, control plans, and disposition process for the line, hold the release gate on every unit, and drive defects to root cause with engineering and suppliers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write the control plan and PFMEA for compute box assembly, and revise them as the process and the design change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set incoming inspection for compute box material: PCBAs, machined and sheet-metal parts, harnesses and cables, with sampling plans and acceptance criteria matched to risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set in-process and outgoing inspection: what is checked, where, by whom, to what standard, and what evidence is recorded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold the release gate: no compute box ships without passing it, and it holds under schedule pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own nonconformance: NCR intake, containment, MRB disposition, and rework instructions, with records that survive an audit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive root cause and corrective action on production defects with electrical, mechanical, firmware, and manufacturing engineering, and verify the fix worked before closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own supplier quality for compute box components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define serialization and traceability for the compute box so the build history of any fielded unit can be recovered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the quality metric set: first-pass yield, defects per unit by category, escape rate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with manufacturing test engineering so inspection and test cover the product together, without gaps and without duplication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed manufacturability and inspectability issues back to design, and hold a seat in design and engineering change reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the documentation backbone the company quality management system will inherit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
