&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Platform &amp;amp; Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; — Design and build the core test infrastructure: harnesses, fixtures, runners, orchestration, and test artifact management for our ZMQ/Cap&#39;n Proto middleware stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simulation-Based Testing&lt;/strong&gt; — Build the simulation infrastructure that lets us run autonomy software against virtual scenarios, with deterministic playback and meaningful coverage of real-world conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD for Robotics&lt;/strong&gt; — Build and maintain the testing pipeline that gates code changes — unit, integration, simulation, and replay-based regression — and integrate it cleanly into the developer workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Log Replay &amp;amp; Recorded Scenario Testing&lt;/strong&gt; — Build infrastructure that converts production logs into reproducible test cases the QA Engineer can curate and the dev team can run&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
