&lt;li&gt;Strong Python — you&#39;ll write substantial code, much of it touching production-adjacent infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and building automation pipelines (CI/CD, test orchestration, build systems)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with at least one large-scale software platform — comfortable thinking in terms of APIs, abstractions, and platform usability&lt;/li&gt;
