&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; pytest, simulation-based&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Docker, GitHub Actions, cloud compute for simulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication/Documentation: &lt;/strong&gt;Slack, Notion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example Projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a simulation harness that runs the full autonomy stack against parameterized mining scenarios in cloud-based parallel execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design a log-to-test-case pipeline that ingests a production log fragment and produces a deterministic replay test the QA Engineer can add to a regression suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a test platform dashboard that surfaces flaky tests, slow tests, and coverage gaps to the QA Engineer and developer lead&lt;/li&gt;
