&lt;li&gt;Strong backend experience in Java building reliable, distributed systems and integrations, with the ability to work across the stack, including front‑end development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear, concise communicator who can explain ideas, trade‑offs, and plans to both technical and non‑technical audiences; strong at writing design docs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent and self‑directed, capable of prioritizing and delivering with minimal supervision while collaborating effectively with cross‑functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about high‑quality code, robustness, no‑regressions, automation, and industry‑leading service uptime; you value testing, observability, and CI/CD.&lt;/li&gt;
