&lt;li&gt;Design resilient, low-latency networking solutions to manage data communication between autonomous vehicles operating in the field and distributed cloud data centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable telemetry, logging, metrics, and tracing infrastructure to monitor the health, performance, and safety of vehicle fleets and cloud services in real time.&lt;/li&gt;
