&lt;li&gt;Practical understanding of networking protocols (TCP/IP, gRPC, WebSockets, MQTT), load balancing, and edge-to-cloud or data center communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing compute orchestration, high-throughput storage pipelines, or GPU workloads for AI/ML training and simulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad system design skills and an infrastructure generalist mindset, comfortable jumping between networking, developer tooling, and compute clusters as priorities evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with hardware is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
