&lt;li&gt;&quot;Bachelor&#39;s or master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Robotics, or a related field required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in systems integration, diagnostics, or hardware and software interface engineering on vehicles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L4 program or production ADAS experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of diagnosing failures that spanned hardware and software, with specific examples where you established the root cause.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to correlate hardware symptoms and video evidence with telemetry and bus data into a concrete timeline.&lt;/li&gt;
