&lt;li&gt;Validation criteria. Define and run the vehicle-level checks a new platform passes before it runs a release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bench to vehicle correlation. Own the documented relationship between bench results and vehicle behavior for each platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calibration, timing, and data integrity. Own multimodal calibration, time synchronization, and the integrity of the sensor to compute path on new platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System debugging. Lead debugging on failures that cross mechanical, electrical, firmware, network, and autonomy boundaries, and stay on them until the root cause is established.&lt;/li&gt;
