&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atoms is building the machines that power the next era of progress.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the last decade, software has transformed the digital world. But the physical world, where food is made, minerals are mined, goods are moved, and industries are run, remains far less intelligent, far less efficient, and far more constrained. We’re changing that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atoms builds Physical AI— real-world robots for the industries that move civilization forward, starting with food, mining, and transport. Our systems are designed to understand, predict, and control the real world with precision, turning complex physical operations into something more reliable, more scalable, and more productive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This work requires more than robotics. It requires deep integration across hardware, software, AI, operations, manufacturing, and real estate. We don’t just build machines in a lab. We deploy them into real environments, operate them, learn from them, and improve them until they work at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are roboticists, engineers, operators, and builders. We believe the next great technology companies will not only transform information, but the physical systems that shape everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to work on hard problems with real-world impact, join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Shipping &amp;amp; Receiving Clerk, you will be responsible for preparing, organizing, and shipping hardware kits that support the deployment of advanced autonomous technology systems at mining sites. This role plays a critical part in ensuring the right materials are accurately kitted, packaged, documented, and shipped on time to support field operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires exceptional organizational skills, attention to detail, and the ability to manage inventory while maintaining accurate shipping records in a fast-paced warehouse environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare, kit, package, and ship hardware, tools, and equipment to field locations and between facilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify kit contents against pick lists, packing lists, and shipping documentation to ensure accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive incoming shipments and inspect materials for damage, accuracy, and completeness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize inventory, stock materials, and maintain orderly storage locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Label, package, and prepare shipments using established shipping procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate outbound shipments with approved shipping carriers and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track shipments and maintain accurate shipping, receiving, and inventory records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with inventory counts, cycle counts, and inventory reconciliation activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fulfill consumable and build inventory requests, and perform related counts to support production needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and report inventory discrepancies, damaged materials, or shipping issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clean, organized, and safe warehouse and shipping areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow established quality, safety, and inventory control procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other warehouse and material handling activities as business needs require&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in shipping, receiving, warehouse, inventory, or logistics operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple shipments and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail and commitment to accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience preparing shipments and maintaining shipping documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic computer skills and experience using inventory or shipping systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently while collaborating effectively with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting manufacturing, robotics, automotive, or technology hardware environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with inventory management or warehouse management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with UPS, FedEx, DHL, or freight shipping processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience performing cycle counts and inventory audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forklift certification or willingness to obtain certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience packaging sensitive electronic or mechanical equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to stand and walk throughout the workday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift, carry, and move materials weighing up to 50 pounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to bend, reach, squat, and perform repetitive lifting and packing tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to safely operate pallet jacks and other warehouse equipment (forklift experience is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Top Skills We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kitting:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to accurately assemble, organize, and verify hardware kits before shipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organization:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong organizational skills to maintain inventory accuracy, manage multiple shipments, and keep warehouse operations running efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to Detail:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensures every shipment is complete, properly documented, and delivered accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintains accurate inventory levels and supports cycle counts and material tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shipping &amp;amp; Logistics:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience preparing outbound shipments and coordinating deliveries to remote field locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Atoms, you’ll work on one of the defining challenges of our time—bringing automation into the physical world to drive real, lasting impact. We exist to uncover valuable unknown truths and turn them into progress, which means constantly pushing beyond what’s known and building what doesn’t yet exist. The work is ambitious and often challenging, but it’s grounded in a shared sense of purpose and a team committed to seeing it through together. Our work only matters if it serves others, and we know that meaningful progress depends on the trust of the people we serve and the strength of our team—so we invest in both, creating an environment where you can do your best work and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
