&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the past, to be a successful restaurateur, you simply had to have a passion for food and a passion for people — but to succeed as a digital restaurateur you also need to have a passion for technology. We believe in the joy of serving others, and that&#39;s why we created Otter – to help restaurateurs succeed in online food delivery. Restaurants around the world, both large and small, including Chick-fil-A, Ben &amp;amp; Jerry&#39;s, KFC, and Eataly trust our software to power their delivery business. We increase sales, reduce order issues, and decrease delivery headaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer on the Otter Customer Lifecycle team, you&#39;ll build the platform that every other team at Otter depends on — the core systems that define what a restaurant &lt;em&gt;is&lt;/em&gt; in our product, and the services that get merchants from signup to serving orders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own the merchant platform: the core services and data models behind stores, facilities, brands, and the entitlement-driven configuration that determines what each merchant can access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design onboarding services that take a new restaurant from signup to live and serving orders, reliably and without manual intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the backend for self-serve growth — signup, activation, and conversion flows that let restaurants adopt Otter without touching a salesperson.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design offboarding and lifecycle cleanup so that when a merchant leaves, the systems behind them shut down cleanly instead of quietly running and costing money.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your services end-to-end: design, build, instrument, debug, and improve reliability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value diversity of experience and are looking for engineers excited to own complex, high-impact systems. We look for a strong sense of ownership — people ready to take their work from idea to production and take responsibility for outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Java or Go, writing production backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid foundation in distributed systems, microservices, and API design (gRPC and/or REST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with databases (e.g. PostgreSQL, CockroachDB) and writing performant queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing data models and core domain objects that other teams build on top of.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating services in production, and a collaborative, product-minded approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workflow orchestration (e.g. Temporal, Cadence) or event-driven architectures (Kafka).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Authentication, authorization, permissions, or entitlements systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with API modernization or migrating services off a legacy stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketplace, merchant platform, subscription, or billing systems experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud platforms (Azure, AWS, GCP) and containers (Docker, Kubernetes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demand for online food delivery is growing really fast! In the last 5 years, just in the US, the overall market has expanded 10X from $10B to $100B, and could expand to $500bn-$1T by 2030.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the restaurant industry&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll be part of a team that helps restaurants succeed in online food delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative environment: You will receive support and guidance from experienced colleagues and managers, helping you to learn, grow and achieve your goals, and you&#39;ll work closely with other teams to ensure our customer&#39;s success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What else you need to know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Mountain View office location. As a company driven by innovation and continuous change, close collaboration is essential. We&#39;re constantly reimagining our industry, creating new products, and refining our processes, and we do our best work together. That&#39;s why all of our office-based teams work onsite, five days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is &lt;strong&gt;$176,000 - $242,000 per year.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actual compensation will be determined on an individual basis and may vary depending on experience, skills, and qualifications.&lt;/p&gt;
