&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we’re reinventing the way employees experience lunch at work. By partnering with top local restaurants and batching hundreds of orders, we make it easy for companies to offer high-quality, individually packed meals, without fees or tips. Our mission is to create a seamless, affordable, and joyful lunch experience that benefits both employees and employers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Strategy &amp;amp; Planning Director, you’ll turn a fast-moving business into a well-organized, goal-driven machine. You’ll own the planning cadence, performance infrastructure, and analytical firepower that keeps every team rowing in the same direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is not a staff role. You’ll own outcomes, not just analyses — and you’ll see the direct impact of your work on how Picnic grows.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Planning &amp;amp; Goal-Setting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Drive quarterly and annual planning processes across all Picnic teams — owning the calendar, the templates, and the quality of outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Partner with the Head of Picnic to define company-level and functional OKRs grounded in business priorities and market realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Build and maintain the performance frameworks (KPIs, leading indicators, scorecards) that tell us whether we’re winning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tracking &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Own the weekly and monthly business review cadence: synthesize data from across the org into a clear picture of where we stand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Flag risks early, surface opportunities proactively, and come with a point of view — not just a dashboard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Work closely with the Data team to translate raw analytics into decisions. SQL and Python fluency will help you move fast without waiting on others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budgeting &amp;amp; Resource Allocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Lead budgeting and forecasting cycles in partnership with our Strategic Finance lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Analyze historical trends to inform headcount, spend, and operational decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Track budget performance and identify where we’re over- or under-resourced relative to priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
