&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Run cross-functional planning sessions and project coordination on high-priority initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Ensure that what leadership decides actually gets executed: translate direction into clear workstreams, owners, and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Projects &amp;amp; Executive Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
