&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Lead strategic analyses and special projects on behalf of the Head of Picnic — market sizing, operational deep-dives, growth opportunity assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Prepare exec-level presentations and business reviews that are sharp, well-structured, and decision-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Be the connective tissue between strategy and execution: wherever something matters and doesn’t have a clear owner, that’s often you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
