&lt;li&gt;Partner with Architecture, Civil, Construction, and Facility Tech teams across Atoms&#39; portfolio companies to resolve structural conflicts and keep designs constructible and cost-effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct structural site assessments and existing-conditions evaluations for retrofit, adaptive reuse, and rapid buildout projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate vendor and manufacturer structural submittals (prefabricated structures, equipment enclosures, modular systems) for code compliance and site suitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and refine standardized structural details and design templates that can be reused across Atoms&#39; different business lines to support rapid, repeatable deployment across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
