&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Specialized Talent Pipelines:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively source passive candidates with specialized experience in Hardware, Mechanical, Electrical and Firmware engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Hiring Leaders:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate directly with Hardware engineering leadership to scope critical roles, refine technical requirements, and align hiring goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Candidate Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver a high-touch, transparent interview journey that reflects our company culture and technical vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze &amp;amp; Iterate:&lt;/strong&gt; Use data and candidate pipeline metrics to optimize search strategies and reduce time-to-hire in a highly competitive market.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
