&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own full-cycle recruiting for highly specialized technical roles across machine learning, AI research, perception, robotics, autonomy, and ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires more than managing a recruiting process. You will need to understand the technical talent you&#39;re looking for, build the market from the ground up, and partner with engineering leaders to determine what great actually looks like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own full-cycle recruiting for AI/ML and related technical roles from intake through offer and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with technical leaders to understand their teams, technology, hiring needs, and the specific talent profiles required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a working understanding of the domains you recruit for—not simply the keywords associated with them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute sourcing strategies for highly specialized and difficult-to-find technical talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and engage passive candidates through thoughtful, targeted outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate technical backgrounds and distinguish between adjacent areas such as ML engineering, AI research, perception, robotics, and ML infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand a candidate&#39;s actual technical contributions, rather than relying solely on titles or company pedigree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage candidates throughout the recruiting process while providing direct, transparent communication and a high-quality candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use recruiting data and market evidence to evaluate pipeline health, identify problems, and adjust search strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with hiring managers to maintain clear expectations, drive timely decisions, and challenge assumptions when the market evidence calls for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help continuously improve our recruiting systems, interview processes, and technical hiring practices as Atoms scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
