&lt;p&gt;Tower Ambassador will receive orders from Drivers, deliver to specified locations within the building, and act as the primary customer contact for eaters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create a community bridge between Picnic and eaters.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
